#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clifford simulation {#clifford-simulation}"
msgstr "Simularea Clifford {#clifford-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Clifford circuits can be simulated efficiently with verifiable "
"results, Clifford simulation is a very useful tool. For an in-depth example,"
" see [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer "
"primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits).\n"
msgstr ""
"Deoarece Circuit-urile Clifford pot fi simulate eficient cu rezultate "
"verificabile, simularea Clifford este un instrument foarte util. Pentru un "
"exemplu detaliat, vezi [Simularea eficientă a Circuit-urilor stabilizatoare "
"cu primitivele Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits).\n"

