#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Use the [`Neat` class](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) to analyze the noise impact on an Estimator workload.\n"
"- Review detailed [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) tutorial.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomandări\">\n"
"- Folosește [clasa `Neat`](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) pentru a analiza impactul zgomotului asupra unui workload Estimator.\n"
"- Consultă [exemple detaliate cu Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Consultă [exemple detaliate cu Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Citește [Migrarea la primitivele V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Exersează cu primitivele parcurgând [lecția despre funcția cost](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) din IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Află cum să transpui local în secțiunea [Transpiler](/guides/transpile).\n"
"- Încearcă tutorialul [Compararea setărilor Transpiler-ului](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
